data: {"id": "cfe65a075be94999-thinking-parallel_evidence-774", "run_id": "cfe65a075be94999", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮采集存在关键缺口：`kubectl_describe` 返回状态为 Running，但未包含 `containerStatuses` 详细信息；`kubernetes_tabular_query` 因语法错误未返回数据；`kubectl_previous_logs` 仅显示最后一次崩溃前的单条错误日志，缺乏完整上下文。需补充采集：\n\n1. **获取 Pod YAML**：确认真实运行状态、容器状态（包括 lastState、state.waiting.reason、restartCount 等）\n2. **获取完整前次日志**：扩大 tail 范围至 500 行，捕获崩溃前的完整日志序列\n3. **获取当前日志**：确认是否仍在 CrashLoopBackOff 循环中\n\n首先获取 Pod YAML 和完整日志：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788791304611, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

