ackOff` 状态，重启次数达 27 次以上，退出码固定为 `2`（`fact-f21d01a0efe8`, `fact-3a423f15d6f3`）。\n  2. **崩溃机制**：日志明确显示 `runtime process exiting`，且伴随 `http_status: 500`（`fact-8ea49a9106c1`）。\n  3. **触发条件**：Tracing 和 Logging 均指向 `/work` 端点（`fact-24b762a1cf33`, `fact-9ebeecabfc1a`）。\n\n- **缺失环节（证据不足部分）**：\n  - 由于日志仅输出 `runtime process exiting` 而无具体的 Traceback（Stack Trace），无法确定具体的编程语言异常类型（如 Python 的 Uncaught Exception 或 C/C++ 的 Segfault）。\n  - 虽然内存显示为 0，但无法完全排除极短时间内的内存尖峰未被监控捕捉（`unknowns` 字段），不过鉴于退出码非 OOM 类型，此可能性较低。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 59.3s (Evidence 49.0s, RCA 10.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 93.59, "metrics": {"run_id": "cfe65a075be94999", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 93.58859181404114, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "w